Third-party scope
=================

- LICENSES/HOL-Light.txt applies conservatively to the formalization as
  second-generation correspondence code for the HOL Light-style Rhombus/HOL
  kernel.
- LICENSES/HOL4.txt applies conservatively to the HOL4-style base logic and
  model theories.
- LICENSES/Isabelle.txt applies to upstream Isabelle/HOL or HOL-ZF source and
  presentation assets reproduced by an HTML presentation from
